title: A Science Compact
subtitle: Public universities want certainty; the coalition wants one more announcement.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_government_card
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and ministries_finalized = 1 and science_minister_party = "Lewica" and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_science_compact_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_science_compact_timer = 5
card-image: img/poland/cards/advisor-wieczorek.webp

= A Science Compact

Rectors arrive with salary tables, researchers with expiring contracts and
students with a list of dormitory rents. The ministry can promise a stable
public system, chase European partnerships or simply expose the funding gap.

- @public_compact
- @european_network
- @publish_the_gap

@public_compact
title: Sign a public university and research compact
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity. Stability buys support inside institutions.
choose-if: budget >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: A multi-year public compact requires two budget points.
on-arrival: budget -= 2; public_sector_support += 5; young_support += 4; government_delivery += 4; progressive_credibility += 2; ko_coalition_dissent += 3 if government_party != "pis"; government_coalition_dissent += 4 if government_party = "pis"; pis_relation -= 2 if government_party = "pis"; news_headline = "Universities receive a public funding and employment compact"

The agreement links grants to secure research careers, student housing and
regional access. [? if government_party != "pis": Liberal ministers warn that
the cabinet has confused a science strategy with a public-sector settlement.?]
[? if government_party = "pis": PiS ministers object to the employment rules
and to university autonomy clauses that reverse Czarnek's influence.?]

- #poland_card_finish


@european_network
title: Build a Central European research network
subtitle: Use European partnerships while the domestic budget remains tight.
on-arrival: eu_influence += 3; eu_left_network += 3; government_delivery += 2; p2050_relation += 2 if government_party != "pis"; pis_relation += 1 if government_party = "pis"; young_support += 1; news_headline = "Poland convenes a regional network for public research"

The ministry joins laboratories and universities around shared grants,
mobility and infrastructure. It cannot replace core funding, but it gives
Polish researchers leverage beyond the next national budget.

- #poland_card_finish


@publish_the_gap
title: Publish the funding and pay gap
subtitle: Free fallback. Name what the coalition will not finance, and be named as the ministry that did not finance it.
on-arrival: public_trust += 2; progressive_credibility += 2; progressives_dissent -= 1; government_coalition_dissent += 3; public_sector_support -= 2; administrative_reform_pressure += 2; last_card_objection = 0; news_headline = "The Science Ministry publishes the cost of precarious research"

The report puts lost staff, temporary contracts and postponed maintenance on
one page. Universities gain an argument; the cabinet gains an uncomfortable
baseline against which every future promise can be measured.

- #poland_card_finish
